WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.469
-Recently the New York City
Rent Guidelines Board

00:00:03.469 --> 00:00:06.672
voted for the biggest
rent increase since 2013.

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:09.509
The board voted to increase rent
on one- and two-year leases

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:12.211
for nearly a million
rent-stabilized apartments
in the city.

00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:14.346
-I'm glad you brought that up,
Meyers.

00:00:14.346 --> 00:00:16.849
I hate to do this,
but I'm gonna have to

00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:19.319
raise the rent on the studio.
-Oh, I'm sorry, everyone.

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:22.354
This is Late Night Studios
landlord Harvey Stool.

00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:24.523
-[ Whistles ]
-What do you --

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:26.726
What do you mean
you're raising the rent, Stool?!

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:28.728
-Well, eh, you know,
through the whole pandemic,

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:30.563
I never raised the rent once.
-Uh-huh.

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:31.797
-But, you know, times are tough,

00:00:31.797 --> 00:00:33.266
and you gotta do
what you gotta do,

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:35.235
and, you know,
I gotta make ends meet.

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.070
-Yep.
-And to be honest, I may have

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.806
heard you've been using the
studio to shoot a second show.

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:41.940
"The Amber Ruffin Show"?
Heard of it?

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:43.042
-Uh-huh.
-You know?

00:00:43.042 --> 00:00:44.343
-Yeah.
-Alright?

00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:45.911
[ Cheers and applause ]
Eh, no, no, no, no!

00:00:45.911 --> 00:00:48.647
That is a violation
of his lease!

00:00:48.647 --> 00:00:50.950
-Who told you we're doing that?

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:53.185
-Doesn't matter who told me.
I could have you evicted.

00:00:53.185 --> 00:00:54.954
-Look, you haven't
really been holding up

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.889
your end of the lease either.
-How so?

00:00:56.889 --> 00:01:01.761
-Well, I have a cartoonishly
large list of things

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:03.262
that need to be fixed
around here,

00:01:03.262 --> 00:01:04.731
and you never seem
to get to 'em!

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:06.399
-Like what?
-Oh, I don't know. Let's see.

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:08.267
The handle on my dressing room
is loose.

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:10.102
One of the urinals
in the guest bathroom

00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:11.237
has been leaking for a month.

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.906
The light on one of
the "Applause" signs

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.674
needs to be replaced
because I'm definitely

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:16.876
not getting the kind of applause
I deserve!

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:18.344
[ Applause ]
And...

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:20.547
[ Cheers and applause ]
-No! No!

00:01:20.547 --> 00:01:22.482
-And!

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:24.751
I've seen a rat
running around the studio!

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:26.419
-Whoa, whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:28.388
There aren't any rats
in the studio.

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:31.791
-Oh, really?
Because look. There he is now!

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.326
-What?!

00:01:34.326 --> 00:01:36.395
I ain't no rat!

00:01:36.395 --> 00:01:39.566
-Then who snitched about us
doing Amber's show in here?!

00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:42.635
-Eh, okay.
Maybe I spilled the beans.

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:44.470
But you can't blame
an egg like me

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:46.305
for trying to make
some extra cabbage.

00:01:46.305 --> 00:01:48.174
-Scram, you,
or I'll have ya bumped off!

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:50.076
-Eh, alright, I'll blow.

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:52.478
But you haven't seen
the last of me, chuckle head.

00:01:52.478 --> 00:01:54.647
-Get out of here,
you damn dirty rat!

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:56.382
-[ Cackling ]

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:59.119
[ Applause ]

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:02.622
-Uh...

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:05.591 line:0%
Uh, the rat left a bunch
of droppings here.

00:02:05.591 --> 00:02:07.226 line:0%
-Uh-huh.
-Ugh!

00:02:07.226 --> 00:02:09.662
Uhp. Nope. Sorry.
Heh. Just Raisinets.

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:11.297
-Okay.
-Okay.

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:12.298
[ Audience groans ]

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:14.033
It's just Raisinets.

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:16.502
Ho, ho, ho!
Okay, I got to go.

00:02:16.502 --> 00:02:18.538
Unless there's anything else
you need me to do here, Meyers.

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:20.806
-Well, there is one more thing.
I had a pizza party for the crew

00:02:20.806 --> 00:02:22.675
last night, we left some of
the crusts in the studio,

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:24.143
and now I think we have ants.

00:02:24.143 --> 00:02:27.179
-I thought I saw a bunch of ants
in here when I came in.

00:02:27.179 --> 00:02:28.547
[ Excited chatter ]

00:02:28.547 --> 00:02:31.117
Oh. Yep. Yep. There they are.
Okay, ladies.

00:02:31.117 --> 00:02:35.053
Shoo! Shoo, shoo!
Shoo, shoo, shoo, shoo!

00:02:35.053 --> 00:02:36.789
Sorry. That was my fault.

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:38.925
After the show, we're gonna
smoke-bomb this place.

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:40.359
That should kill all of them.

00:02:40.359 --> 00:02:42.862
-Who even told the aunts
we had pizza?

00:02:42.862 --> 00:02:45.265
-[ Cackling ]

00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:47.066
-I thought I told you to scram,
you rat!

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:51.203
-Ehh! Eat beans, Meyers!
[ Cackling ]

00:02:51.203 --> 00:02:54.707
-Ah. More Raisinets.
[ Laughs ]

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.576
No. Nope.
That was not a Raisinet.

00:02:56.576 --> 00:02:58.678
-Okay. Well, then.
That's disgusting.

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:01.514
-Alright. Ah, well, I gotta go.
-Okay.

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:04.750
-But there is one more thing.
-What's that?

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.218
-Ha ha ha.

00:03:06.218 --> 00:03:07.987
This has been
a real silly sketch

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:10.356
we decided to do just for fun!

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:13.392
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.392 --> 00:03:14.560
-Did you, uh...

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:18.297
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:18.297 --> 00:03:20.867
Did you think there was gonna be
like a title card or something?

00:03:20.867 --> 00:03:22.101
-Yep.

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:24.069
-Did you ask anybody
to make you one?

00:03:24.069 --> 00:03:25.638
-Nope. [ Chuckles ]
-Seth Meyers!

00:03:25.638 --> 00:03:27.740
-Oh, great.
Here come the ants again.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:30.142
-You know, this feed is a lot
like that Geico commercial.

00:03:30.142 --> 00:03:31.711
-Ah, didn't see it.
I had to sell my TV.

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:33.112
-Alright. Great.

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:34.813
-Don't miss
"The Amber Ruffin Show"

00:03:34.813 --> 00:03:36.082
Friday nights on Peacock.

00:03:36.082 --> 00:03:37.817
It's shot right here
in this studio.

00:03:37.817 --> 00:03:41.521
-I knew it! Get out!
You're gonna get evicted!

00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:43.089
You're gonna get evicted!
Get out! Get out!

00:03:43.089 --> 00:03:46.893
-We'll be right back
with Celeste Ng.

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:48.594
You're in my shot.

00:03:48.594 --> 00:03:50.396
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:50.396 --> 00:03:54.100 line:0%
♪♪

